{"reference":"Judges 12","book":"Judges","chapter":12,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Judges in Context","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The programmatic pattern in Judges 2 helps guide the central narratives, but the individual episodes do not all include every stage or follow a mechanically identical cycle. Judges 12 therefore belongs within the book’s larger sequence of narratives without requiring that its events reproduce the full pattern in the same way.","verse_refs":["Judges 1","Judges 10:1-18","Judges 11:1-40","Judges 13:1-25","Judges 14:1-20","Judges 15:1-20","Judges 16:1-31","Judges 2:1-23","Judges 3:1-31","Judges 3:7-31","Judges 4:1-24","Judges 5:1-31","Judges 6:1-40","Judges 7:1-25","Judges 8:1-35","Judges 9:1-57"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_judges_012_368c1610e7cf8e18d460b024"],"confidence":"low","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}